{#- A character's own knowledge sections, first half (NFR-PRIV-4, #170; #826): its definition,
its deflection style and its own true age, then ``## What you believe``, ``## Your sense of time``
and ``## Your private memories``. Every section but the definition comes from its
``CharacterContext`` (``core.epistemic.context.build_context``). Shared by the character render
(``structured_generation.j2``) and a consumer purpose's viewpoint (``viewpoint.j2``), so both
send the same text. -#}
{% for character in character_definitions %}
## You are {{ character.name }}
{{ character.definition }}
{% if character.deflection_style %}
When {{ character.name }} refuses or changes the subject: {{ character.deflection_style }}
{% endif %}
{% if own_age %}
{{ own_age }}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% if beliefs %}
## What you believe
{% for line in beliefs %}
- {{ line }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if time_belief %}
## Your sense of time
{{ time_belief }}

{% endif %}
{% if private_memories %}
## Your private memories
{% for memory in private_memories %}
- {{ memory }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
